  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"244\">🍎 <strong data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"244\">Apple Magic Keyboard (Model A1644) incl. Doos | Zo Goed Als Nieuw | €54,99</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"373\"><strong data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"259\">💰 Prijs:</strong> €54,99<br data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"269\"><strong data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"282\">📦 Staat:</strong> Zo Goed Als Nieuw (ZGAN) – getest en 100% functioneel<br data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"339\"><strong data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"356\">🎁 Inclusief:</strong> Originele doos</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"677\">Het <strong data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"415\">Apple Magic Keyboard model A1644</strong> combineert een strak design met een uitstekend typergevoel.<br data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"478\">Dankzij het slanke aluminium ontwerp en de stille toetsen typ je comfortabel en nauwkeurig.<br data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"572\">Deze uitvoering verkeert in <strong data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"614\">ZGAN-staat</strong>, is volledig getest en wordt geleverd met de originele doos.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"682\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"711\">⚙️ <strong data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"709\">Specificaties:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"963\">\r\n<li data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"741\">\r\n<p data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"741\">💻 <strong data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"733\">Modelnummer:</strong> A1644</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"788\">\r\n<p data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"788\">🔋 <strong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"762\">Oplaadbaar:</strong> Ja, via Lightning-kabel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"821\">\r\n<p data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"821\">🔗 <strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"809\">Verbinding:</strong> Bluetooth</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"895\">\r\n<p data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"895\">🧭 <strong data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"847\">Compatibiliteit:</strong> macOS, iPadOS, iOS en Windows (via Bluetooth)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"926\">\r\n<p data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"926\">⚙️ <strong data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"912\">Layout:</strong> QWERTY (NL)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"963\">\r\n<p data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"963\">🎁 <strong data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"946\">Inclusief:</strong> Originele doos</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"968\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"993\">🌟 <strong data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"991\">Voordelen:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1173\">✅ Originele Apple kwaliteit<br data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1024\">✅ In <strong data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1043\">ZGAN-staat</strong>, getest en werkend<br data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1065\">✅ Stille en comfortabele toetsaanslag<br data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1105\">✅ Compact, licht en draadloos<br data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1137\">✅ Wordt geleverd in originele doos</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1178\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1276\">🎯 <strong data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1193\">Prijs:</strong> €54,99<br data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1203\">🚚 Ophalen of verzenden mogelijk<br data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1238\">💬 Wordt zorgvuldig verpakt geleverd</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1281\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1417\"><strong data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1299\">Trefwoorden:</strong> Apple Magic Keyboard A1644, Magic Keyboard ZGAN, Apple toetsenbord, draadloos keyboard Mac, Magic Keyboard met doos</p>",
